<p dir=3D"auto">This CSS style is an effective method of styling a single p=
age. However, using this style for multiple pages is time-consuming as you =
need to put CSS rules to every page of your website.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>3. External CSS:</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">In external CSS rules are stored in a separate file. To ref=
