<p dir=3D"auto">The link element in the example has three attributes. The f=
irst, <code>rel</code>, tells the browser the type of the target of the lin=
k. The second, <code>type</code>, tells the browser what type of stylesheet=
 it is. And the third, <code>href</code>, tells the browser under which URL=
 to find the stylesheet.</p>
