<p dir=3D"auto">The <code>box-sizing</code> property controls how the total=
 width and height of an element is calculated.</p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Property</th>
<th>Width Calculation</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>content-box</code> (default)</td>
<td><code>width</code> =3D content only. Padding and border are <strong>add=
ed</strong> on top.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>border-box</code></td>
<td><code>width</code> =3D content + padding + border. They are <strong>inc=
luded</strong> inside the declared width.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
