<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Property Values:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Value</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>content-box</td>
<td>Default. The width and height properties (and min/max properties) inclu=
des only the content. Border and padding are not included</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>border-box</td>
<td>The width and height properties (and min/max properties) includes conte=
nt, padding and border</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>initial</td>
<td>Sets this property to its default value. Read about initial</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>inherit</td>
<td>Inherits this property from its parent element. Read about inherit</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
