ack to top</a></b>
</div>
<div class=3D"markdown-heading" dir=3D"auto"><h2 tabindex=3D"-1" class=3D"h=
eading-element" dir=3D"auto">Q. What is the difference between padding and =
margin?</h2><a id=3D"user-content-q-what-is-the-difference-between-padding-=
and-margin-1" class=3D"anchor" aria-label=3D"Permalink: Q. What is the diff=
erence between padding and margin?" href=3D"https://github.com/learning-zon=
e/css-basics#q-what-is-the-difference-between-padding-and-margin-1"><svg da=
