fference-between-pseudo-classes-and-pseudo-elements"><svg data-component=3D=
"Octicon" class=3D"octicon octicon-link" viewBox=3D"0 0 16 16" version=3D"1=
.1" width=3D"16" height=3D"16" aria-hidden=3D"true"><path d=3D"m7.775 3.275=
