<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Specificity</strong> is the algorithm browsers use =
to determine which CSS rule takes precedence when multiple rules target the=
 same element.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Specificity Hierarchy (lowest =E2=86=92 highest)</s=
trong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
