<p dir=3D"auto"><code>:root</code> targets the root element of the document=
 tree, which in HTML is the <code>&lt;html&gt;</code> element. Despite targ=
eting the same element, <code>:root</code> has <strong>higher specificity</=
strong> than the <code>html</code> type selector.</p>
