<th><code>:is()</code></th>
<th><code>:where()</code></th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Selector matching</td>
<td>Same</td>
<td>Same</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Specificity</td>
<td>Highest of its arguments</td>
<td>Always <strong>0</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Use case</td>
<td>Normal selector shorthand</td>
<td>Low-specificity base styles</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
