<p dir=3D"auto"><code>:has()</code> is a relational pseudo-class that selec=
ts an element <strong>if any of the selectors passed as arguments match at =
least one element relative to it</strong>. It is effectively a "parent sele=
ctor" or "conditional selector".</p>
