1.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.=
5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<p dir=3D"auto">Structural pseudo-classes match elements based on their pos=
ition in the document tree. The most flexible are <code>:nth-child(An+B)</c=
ode> and <code>:nth-of-type(An+B)</code>, which accept a formula where:</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li><strong>A</strong> is the cycle size (step)</li>
<li><strong>n</strong> is a counter starting at 0</li>
<li><strong>B</strong> is an offset</li>
</ul>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Expression</th>
<th>Matches</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>:nth-child(odd)</code> or <code>:nth-child(2n+1)</code></td>
<td>1st, 3rd, 5th, =E2=80=A6</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>:nth-child(even)</code> or <code>:nth-child(2n)</code></td>
<td>2nd, 4th, 6th, =E2=80=A6</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>:nth-child(3n)</code></td>
<td>3rd, 6th, 9th, =E2=80=A6</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>:nth-child(3n+1)</code></td>
<td>1st, 4th, 7th, =E2=80=A6</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>:nth-child(-n+3)</code></td>
<td>First 3 elements</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>:nth-last-child(2)</code></td>
<td>Second from the end</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Example:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"highlight highlight-source-css notranslate position-relative =
overflow-auto" dir=3D"auto"><pre><span class=3D"pl-c">/* Zebra-stripe a tab=
le */</span>
<span class=3D"pl-ent">tr</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span><span class=
=3D"pl-c1">nth-child</span>(even) {
  <span class=3D"pl-c1">background-color</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</sp=
an> <span class=3D"pl-pds"><span class=3D"pl-kos">#</span>f2f2f2</span>;
}

<span class=3D"pl-c">/* Highlight the first 3 items in a list */</span>
<span class=3D"pl-ent">li</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span><span class=
=3D"pl-c1">nth-child</span>(-n+3) {
  <span class=3D"pl-c1">font-weight</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> b=
old;
  <span class=3D"pl-c1">color</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> <span c=
lass=3D"pl-pds"><span class=3D"pl-kos">#</span>3498db</span>;
}

<span class=3D"pl-c">/* Every third paragraph */</span>
<span class=3D"pl-ent">p</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span><span class=
=3D"pl-c1">nth-of-type</span>(<span class=3D"pl-c1">3<span class=3D"pl-smi"=
>n</span></span>) {
  <span class=3D"pl-c1">margin-bottom</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span>=
