<p dir=3D"auto">UI state pseudo-classes reflect the current interactive sta=
te of form controls, enabling contextual styling without JavaScript.</p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Pseudo-class</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>:checked</code></td>
<td>Checkbox, radio, or <code>&lt;option&gt;</code> that is selected</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>:enabled</code></td>
<td>Form element that is enabled</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>:disabled</code></td>
<td>Form element with the <code>disabled</code> attribute</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>:focus</code></td>
<td>Element that currently has keyboard/mouse focus</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>:focus-within</code></td>
<td>Element that contains a focused descendant</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>:focus-visible</code></td>
<td>Element focused via keyboard (not mouse click)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>:valid</code></td>
<td>Input whose value passes its validation constraint</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>:invalid</code></td>
<td>Input whose value fails its validation constraint</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>:required</code></td>
<td>Input with the <code>required</code> attribute</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>:optional</code></td>
<td>Input without the <code>required</code> attribute</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>:in-range</code></td>
<td>Input whose value is within <code>min</code>/<code>max</code> bounds</t=
d>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>:out-of-range</code></td>
<td>Input whose value exceeds <code>min</code>/<code>max</code> bounds</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>:placeholder-shown</code></td>
<td>Input currently displaying its placeholder text</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>:read-only</code></td>
<td>Element with the <code>readonly</code> attribute</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>:read-write</code></td>
<td>Element that is editable</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>:indeterminate</code></td>
<td>Checkbox or radio in an indeterminate state</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Example:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"highlight highlight-source-css notranslate position-relative =
overflow-auto" dir=3D"auto"><pre><span class=3D"pl-c">/* Style valid and in=
valid inputs */</span>
<span class=3D"pl-ent">input</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span><span cla=
ss=3D"pl-c1">valid</span> {
  <span class=3D"pl-c1">border-color</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> =
<span class=3D"pl-pds"><span class=3D"pl-kos">#</span>2ecc71</span>;
}

<span class=3D"pl-ent">input</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span><span cla=
ss=3D"pl-c1">invalid</span> {
  <span class=3D"pl-c1">border-color</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> =
<span class=3D"pl-pds"><span class=3D"pl-kos">#</span>e74c3c</span>;
}

<span class=3D"pl-c">/* Show error message only when input is invalid and n=
ot empty */</span>
<span class=3D"pl-ent">input</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span><span cla=
ss=3D"pl-c1">not</span>(<span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span><span class=3D"pl-c1=
">placeholder-shown</span>)<span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span><span class=3D"pl=
-c1">invalid</span> <span class=3D"pl-c1">+</span> .<span class=3D"pl-c1">e=
rror-msg</span> {
  <span class=3D"pl-c1">display</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> block=
;
}

<span class=3D"pl-c">/* Focus styling that doesn\'t show on mouse click */<=
/span>
<span class=3D"pl-ent">button</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span><span cl=
ass=3D"pl-c1">focus-visible</span> {
  <span class=3D"pl-c1">outline</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> <span=
 class=3D"pl-c1">3<span class=3D"pl-smi">px</span></span> solid <span class=
=3D"pl-pds"><span class=3D"pl-kos">#</span>3498db</span>;
  <span class=3D"pl-c1">outline-offset</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span=
> <span class=3D"pl-c1">2<span class=3D"pl-smi">px</span></span>;
}

<span class=3D"pl-c">/* Dim disabled inputs */</span>
<span class=3D"pl-ent">input</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span><span cla=
ss=3D"pl-c1">disabled</span> {
  <span class=3D"pl-c1">opacity</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> <span=
 class=3D"pl-c1">0.5</span>;
  <span class=3D"pl-c1">cursor</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> not-al=
lowed;
}</pre><div class=3D"zeroclipboard-container">
