<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Feature</th>
<th>CSS Transition</th>
<th>CSS Animation</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Trigger</td>
<td>Requires a state change (e.g., <code>:hover</code>)</td>
<td>Can run automatically on page load</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Keyframes</td>
<td>Not supported</td>
<td>Defined with <code>@keyframes</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Intermediate steps</td>
<td>Only start and end states</td>
<td>Multiple intermediate keyframe steps</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Looping</td>
<td>Cannot loop</td>
<td>Can loop with <code>animation-iteration-count</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Direction</td>
<td>Always plays forward</td>
<td>Can play in reverse or alternate with <code>animation-direction</code><=
/td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>JavaScript required</td>
<td>No (CSS-only trigger via pseudo-class)</td>
<td>No</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Complexity</td>
<td>Simple A =E2=86=92 B transitions</td>
<td>Complex multi-step sequences</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
