<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Property</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>animation</code></td>
<td>Shorthand for all animation properties</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>animation-name</code></td>
<td>Name of the <code>@keyframes</code> rule to apply</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>animation-duration</code></td>
<td>How long one cycle of the animation takes (e.g., <code>1s</code>, <code=
>500ms</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>animation-timing-function</code></td>
<td>Speed curve of the animation (<code>ease</code>, <code>linear</code>, <=
code>ease-in</code>, <code>ease-out</code>, <code>cubic-bezier(...)</code>)=
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>animation-delay</code></td>
<td>Delay before the animation starts</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>animation-iteration-count</code></td>
<td>Number of times the animation repeats (<code>1</code>, <code>infinite</=
code>, etc.)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>animation-direction</code></td>
<td>Whether animation plays forward, backward, or alternates (<code>normal<=
/code>, <code>reverse</code>, <code>alternate</code>, <code>alternate-rever=
se</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>animation-fill-mode</code></td>
<td>Styles applied before/after the animation runs (<code>none</code>, <cod=
e>forwards</code>, <code>backwards</code>, <code>both</code>)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>animation-play-state</code></td>
<td>Whether animation is running or paused (<code>running</code>, <code>pau=
sed</code>)</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
