<p dir=3D"auto"><strong><code>transform-style</code></strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Defines whether child elements are rendered in 3D space or =
flattened in the plane of the parent.</p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Value</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>flat</code> (default)</td>
<td>Children are rendered flat in the parent's plane</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>preserve-3d</code></td>
<td>Children maintain their own 3D position</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong><code>backface-visibility</code></strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Controls whether the back face of an element is visible whe=
n rotated away from the viewer.</p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Value</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>visible</code> (default)</td>
<td>Back face is visible when turned toward the viewer</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>hidden</code></td>
<td>Back face is hidden; useful for card-flip effects</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
