<p dir=3D"auto">CSS <code>transform</code> (with any value other than <code=
>none</code>) creates a new <strong>stacking context</strong> and a new <st=
rong>containing block</strong> for fixed-position descendants.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Key effects:</strong></p>
<ol dir=3D"auto">
<li>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Stacking context:</strong> A transformed element an=
d its children are stacked independently from surrounding elements. <code>z=
-index</code> applies among siblings within the same stacking context.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Document flow:</strong> Transforms do <strong>not</=
strong> affect the element's layout footprint. The space the element occupi=
es in the flow remains based on its original position and size; only the vi=
sual rendering changes.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Containing block for <code>position: fixed</code>:<=
/strong> A <code>position: fixed</code> child of a transformed element is p=
ositioned relative to the transformed ancestor, <strong>not</strong> the vi=
ewport.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Example:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"highlight highlight-source-css notranslate position-relative =
overflow-auto" dir=3D"auto"><pre><span class=3D"pl-c">/* The .box occupies =
its original space in flow,</span>
<span class=3D"pl-c">   but visually appears shifted/rotated */</span>
.<span class=3D"pl-c1">box</span> {
  <span class=3D"pl-c1">transform</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> <sp=
an class=3D"pl-en">translateX</span>(<span class=3D"pl-c1">50<span class=3D=
"pl-smi">px</span></span>) <span class=3D"pl-en">rotate</span>(<span class=
=3D"pl-c1">15<span class=3D"pl-smi">deg</span></span>);
  <span class=3D"pl-c">/* Document flow: unchanged */</span>
  <span class=3D"pl-c">/* Visual position: shifted */</span>
}

<span class=3D"pl-c">/* position: fixed inside a transformed parent */</spa=
n>
.<span class=3D"pl-c1">transformed-parent</span> {
  <span class=3D"pl-c1">transform</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> <sp=
an class=3D"pl-en">translateZ</span>(<span class=3D"pl-c1">0</span>); <span=
 class=3D"pl-c">/* creates containing block */</span>
}
.<span class=3D"pl-c1">fixed-child</span> {
  <span class=3D"pl-c1">position</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> fixe=
d; <span class=3D"pl-c">/* now relative to .transformed-parent, not viewpor=
t */</span>
  <span class=3D"pl-c1">top</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> <span cla=
ss=3D"pl-c1">0</span>;
  <span class=3D"pl-c1">left</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> <span cl=
ass=3D"pl-c1">0</span>;
}</pre><div class=3D"zeroclipboard-container">
