<p dir=3D"auto">Inline SVG can be targeted directly by CSS selectors. SVG l=
oaded via <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> or <code>background-image</code> cannot =
be styled from an external stylesheet =E2=80=94 use inline <code>&lt;svg&gt=
;</code> for full CSS control.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>SVG-specific CSS properties:</strong></p>
