</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>stroke-width</code></td>
<td>Thickness of the stroke</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>stroke-linecap</code></td>
<td>Shape of open-path ends: <code>butt</code>, <code>round</code>, <code>s=
quare</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>stroke-dasharray</code></td>
<td>Pattern of dashes and gaps in a stroke</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>stroke-dashoffset</code></td>
<td>Offset of the dash pattern =E2=80=94 used for path-drawing animations</=
td>
</tr>
