ter flex-items-center" data-copy-feedback=3D"Copied!" data-tooltip-directio=
n=3D"w" value=3D"/* Target SVG shapes with standard CSS selectors */
svg circle {
  fill: steelblue;
  stroke: #1a1a1a;
  stroke-width: 2;
  transition: fill 0.3s ease;
}

svg circle:hover {
  fill: coral;
