<div class=3D"markdown-heading" dir=3D"auto"><h2 tabindex=3D"-1" class=3D"h=
eading-element" dir=3D"auto">Q. How is responsive design different from ada=
ptive design?</h2><a id=3D"user-content-q-how-is-responsive-design-differen=
t-from-adaptive-design" class=3D"anchor" aria-label=3D"Permalink: Q. How is=
 responsive design different from adaptive design?" href=3D"https://github.=
com/learning-zone/css-basics#q-how-is-responsive-design-different-from-adap=
tive-design"><svg data-component=3D"Octicon" class=3D"octicon octicon-link"=
 viewBox=3D"0 0 16 16" version=3D"1.1" width=3D"16" height=3D"16" aria-hidd=
