<p dir=3D"auto">The <code>&lt;meta name=3D"viewport"&gt;</code> tag instruc=
ts the browser on how to control the page's dimensions and scaling on mobil=
e devices. Without it, mobile browsers render the page at a desktop width a=
nd then scale it down, making content tiny.</p>
