<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>width</code></td>
<td>Sets the viewport width. <code>device-width</code> equals the device's =
screen width</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>initial-scale</code></td>
<td>Sets the initial zoom level (1.0 =3D no zoom)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>minimum-scale</code></td>
<td>Minimum zoom level the user can set</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>maximum-scale</code></td>
<td>Maximum zoom level the user can set</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>user-scalable</code></td>
<td>Whether the user can zoom (<code>yes</code> or <code>no</code>)</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
