</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>not</code></td>
<td>Negates the entire media query</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>only</code></td>
<td>Prevents older browsers from applying the style; invisible to modern br=
owsers</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>,</code> (comma)</td>
<td>Acts like <code>or</code> =E2=80=94 applies if any condition is true</t=
d>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
