<p dir=3D"auto">Fluid images scale with their parent container rather than =
having fixed dimensions, preventing images from overflowing on smaller scre=
ens.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Basic fluid image:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"highlight highlight-source-css notranslate position-relative =
overflow-auto" dir=3D"auto"><pre><span class=3D"pl-ent">img</span> {
