</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>vh</code></td>
<td>1% of the viewport <strong>height</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>vmin</code></td>
<td>1% of the <strong>smaller</strong> viewport dimension (min of width or =
height)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>vmax</code></td>
<td>1% of the <strong>larger</strong> viewport dimension (max of width or h=
eight)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>svh</code></td>
<td>1% of the <strong>small viewport height</strong> (excludes browser UI o=
n mobile)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>dvh</code></td>
<td>1% of the <strong>dynamic viewport height</strong> (updates as UI shows=
/hides)</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
