<p dir=3D"auto">Because CSS variables are resolved by the browser at runtim=
e, they can be updated via JavaScript or by toggling a class, enabling live=
 theme switching without reloading the page.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Example =E2=80=94 light/dark theme toggle:</strong>=
</p>
<div class=3D"highlight highlight-source-css notranslate position-relative =
overflow-auto" dir=3D"auto"><pre><span class=3D"pl-c">/* Light theme (defau=
lt) */</span>
<span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span><span class=3D"pl-c1">root</span> {
  <span class=3D"pl-s1">--bg</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> <span cl=
ass=3D"pl-pds"><span class=3D"pl-kos">#</span>ffffff</span>;
  <span class=3D"pl-s1">--text</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> <span =
class=3D"pl-pds"><span class=3D"pl-kos">#</span>222222</span>;
  <span class=3D"pl-s1">--surface</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> <sp=
an class=3D"pl-pds"><span class=3D"pl-kos">#</span>f5f5f5</span>;
  <span class=3D"pl-s1">--accent</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> <spa=
n class=3D"pl-pds"><span class=3D"pl-kos">#</span>3498db</span>;
}

<span class=3D"pl-c">/* Dark theme =E2=80=94 override variables on the root=
 */</span>
