<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Limitation</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><strong>Cannot be used in media query conditions</strong></td>
<td><code>@media (min-width: var(--bp))</code> is invalid</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>No type safety</strong></td>
<td>Any value can be assigned; invalid values silently fall back</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>No math operators</strong></td>
<td>Must use <code>calc()</code> for arithmetic</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Not supported in property names</strong></td>
<td><code>var(--prop): value</code> is invalid =E2=80=94 only in values</td=
>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Not accessible in <code>@keyframes</code> at-rules in some cont=
exts</strong></td>
<td>Variables inside keyframes must be defined on the element, not just <co=
de>:root</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>No built-in list/array support</strong></td>
<td>Workarounds use space-separated values and <code>calc()</code> index tr=
icks</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Internet Explorer</strong></td>
<td>Not supported at all (IE 11 and below)</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
