<p dir=3D"auto"><code>line-height</code> controls the height of a line box,=
 which affects the vertical spacing between lines of text. It can be set as=
 a unitless number, percentage, length, or keyword.</p>
<div class=3D"highlight highlight-source-css notranslate position-relative =
overflow-auto" dir=3D"auto"><pre><span class=3D"pl-c">/* Unitless (recommen=
ded): multiplied by the element\'s own font-size */</span>
