<tr>
<th>Value</th>
<th>Behavior</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>normal</code></td>
<td>Default; does not break words</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>break-word</code></td>
<td>Breaks long words only when necessary to prevent overflow</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>anywhere</code></td>
<td>Like <code>break-word</code> but also considered for min-content size</=
td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
