<p dir=3D"auto"><code>backdrop-filter</code> applies graphical effects (blu=
r, brightness, etc.) to the area <strong>behind</strong> an element, creati=
ng frosted-glass and overlay effects. <code>filter</code> applies effects t=
o the <strong>element itself and its children</strong>.</p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Feature</th>
<th><code>filter</code></th>
<th><code>backdrop-filter</code></th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Applies to</td>
<td>The element + its children</td>
<td>Everything <strong>behind</strong> the element</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Common use</td>
<td>Image effects, grayscale, brightness</td>
<td>Frosted glass, blurred overlays</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Requires transparency</td>
<td>No</td>
<td><strong>Yes</strong> =E2=80=94 background must be semi-transparent to s=
ee the effect</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Performance</td>
<td>Compositing</td>
<td>Compositing (same cost)</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
