<p dir=3D"auto"><code>z-index</code> has <strong>no effect</strong> on elem=
ents with <code>position: static</code> (the default). For <code>z-index</c=
ode> to work, the element must have a <code>position</code> value of <code>=
relative</code>, <code>absolute</code>, <code>fixed</code>, or <code>sticky=
</code>.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Example:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"highlight highlight-source-css notranslate position-relative =
overflow-auto" dir=3D"auto"><pre><span class=3D"pl-c">/* z-index is IGNORED=
 =E2=80=94 element is static */</span>
.<span class=3D"pl-c1">static-element</span> {
  <span class=3D"pl-c1">position</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> stat=
ic;   <span class=3D"pl-c">/* default */</span>
  <span class=3D"pl-c1">z-index</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> <span=
 class=3D"pl-c1">100</span>;       <span class=3D"pl-c">/* has no effect */=
</span>
}

<span class=3D"pl-c">/* z-index WORKS =E2=80=94 element is positioned */</s=
pan>
.<span class=3D"pl-c1">positioned-element</span> {
  <span class=3D"pl-c1">position</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> rela=
tive;
  <span class=3D"pl-c1">z-index</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> <span=
 class=3D"pl-c1">100</span>;       <span class=3D"pl-c">/* works correctly =
*/</span>
}</pre><div class=3D"zeroclipboard-container">
