<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Common causes of z-index not working:</strong></p>
<ol dir=3D"auto">
<li><strong>Element is not positioned</strong> =E2=80=94 add <code>position=
: relative/absolute/fixed/sticky</code></li>
<li><strong>Parent creates a stacking context</strong> =E2=80=94 a parent w=
ith <code>opacity &lt; 1</code>, <code>transform</code>, or a non-auto <cod=
e>z-index</code> traps children</li>
<li><strong>Comparing elements in different stacking contexts</strong> =E2=
=80=94 z-index only competes within the same context</li>
<li><strong>Forgot to set z-index as an integer</strong> =E2=80=94 <code>z-=
index: 1px</code> is invalid</li>
</ol>
