<p dir=3D"auto">Both values add scrollbars when content overflows, but they=
 behave differently:</p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Feature</th>
<th><code>overflow: scroll</code></th>
<th><code>overflow: auto</code></th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Scrollbars shown</td>
<td><strong>Always</strong> (even if not needed)</td>
<td><strong>Only when content overflows</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Layout space for scrollbar</td>
<td>Always reserved</td>
<td>Reserved only when required</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Use case</td>
<td>Consistent layout, avoid reflow</td>
<td>Cleaner UI, scrollbar appears on demand</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
