<p dir=3D"auto"><code>overflow: clip</code> (introduced in CSS Overflow Lev=
el 3) clips overflow at the element's <strong>overflow clip edge</strong> =
=E2=80=94 similar to <code>hidden</code> but with one key difference: it do=
es <strong>not</strong> create a Block Formatting Context (BFC).</p>
