</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Mask source</td>
<td>Image, gradient, SVG element</td>
<td>Geometric shape or SVG <code>path()</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Soft edges</td>
<td><strong>Yes</strong> =E2=80=94 gradient masks fade smoothly</td>
<td>No =E2=80=94 hard binary edges</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Partial transparency</td>
<td><strong>Yes</strong> =E2=80=94 semi-transparent mask =3D semi-visible e=
lement</td>
<td>No</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Performance</td>
<td>Slightly heavier (compositing layer)</td>
<td>Lighter</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Browser prefix</td>
<td>Requires <code>-webkit-mask-*</code> for Safari</td>
<td>No prefix needed</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
