<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Benefits:</strong></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li><strong>Modularity</strong>: Block styles are never dependent on other =
elements on a page, so you will never experience problems from cascading.</=
li>
<li><strong>Reusability</strong>: Composing independent blocks in different=
 ways, and reusing them intelligently, reduces the amount of CSS code that =
you will have to maintain.</li>
<li><strong>Structure</strong>: BEM methodology gives your CSS code a solid=
 structure that remains simple and easy to understand.</li>
</ul>
