<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>CSS Counter Properties:</strong></p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Property</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>content</td>
<td>Used with the ::before and ::after pseudo-elements, to insert generated=
 content</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>counter-increment</td>
<td>Increments one or more counter values</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>counter-reset</td>
<td>Creates or resets one or more counters</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Example:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"highlight highlight-text-html-basic notranslate position-rela=
