<p dir=3D"auto">The clear property specifies what elements can float beside=
 the cleared element and on which side.</p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table data-catalyst=3D""><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Sl.No</th>
<th>Properties</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>01.</td>
<td>clear: none</td>
<td>Allows floating elements on both sides. This is default</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>02.</td>
<td>clear: left</td>
<td>No floating elements allowed on the left side</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>03.</td>
<td>clear: right</td>
<td>No floating elements allowed on the right side</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>04.</td>
<td>clear: both</td>
<td>No floating elements allowed on either the left or the right side</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>05.</td>
<td>clear: inherit</td>
<td>The element inherits the clear value of its parent</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
