<p dir=3D"auto">A mobile-first strategy has 2 main advantages:</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>It's more performant on mobile devices, since all the rules applied for=
 them don't have to be validated against any media queries.</li>
<li>It forces to write cleaner code in respect to responsive CSS rules.</li=
>
</ul>
