<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>CSS prefixes</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">The major browsers use the following prefixes:</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li><code>-webkit-</code> (Chrome, Safari, newer versions of Opera, almost =
all iOS browsers including Firefox for iOS; basically, any WebKit based bro=
wser)</li>
<li><code>-moz-</code> (Firefox)</li>
<li><code>-o-</code> (old pre-WebKit versions of Opera)</li>
<li><code>-ms-</code> (Internet Explorer and Microsoft Edge)</li>
</ul>
