<p dir=3D"auto">CSS Scroll Snap lets you define <strong>snap points</strong=
> along a scroll container so that scrolling snaps precisely to specified p=
ositions =E2=80=94 creating smooth, paged, or carousel-style experiences wi=
thout JavaScript.</p>
