<p dir=3D"auto"><code>@layer</code> (CSS Cascade Layers, introduced in CSS =
2022) lets you explicitly control the order of specificity between groups o=
f styles. Layers defined earlier have <strong>lower priority</strong> than =
layers defined later, regardless of selector specificity within them.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Problem it solves:</strong> In large codebases or w=
hen combining third-party styles with your own, specificity conflicts are h=
ard to manage. <code>@layer</code> provides an ordered structure.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Syntax:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"highlight highlight-source-css notranslate position-relative =
overflow-auto" dir=3D"auto"><pre><span class=3D"pl-c">/* 1. Declare layer o=
rder (lowest =E2=86=92 highest priority) */</span>
<span class=3D"pl-k">@layer</span> reset<span class=3D"pl-kos">,</span> bas=
e<span class=3D"pl-kos">,</span> components<span class=3D"pl-kos">,</span> =
utilities;

<span class=3D"pl-c">/* 2. Assign styles to layers */</span>
<span class=3D"pl-k">@layer</span> reset {
  <span class=3D"pl-ent"><span class=3D"pl-c1">*</span></span><span class=
=3D"pl-kos">,</span> <span class=3D"pl-ent"><span class=3D"pl-c1">*</span><=
/span>::<span class=3D"pl-c1">before</span><span class=3D"pl-kos">,</span> =
<span class=3D"pl-ent"><span class=3D"pl-c1">*</span></span>::<span class=
=3D"pl-c1">after</span> { <span class=3D"pl-c1">box-sizing</span><span clas=
s=3D"pl-kos">:</span> border-box; }
  <span class=3D"pl-ent">body</span> { <span class=3D"pl-c1">margin</span><=
span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> <span class=3D"pl-c1">0</span>; }
}

<span class=3D"pl-k">@layer</span> base {
  <span class=3D"pl-ent">h1</span> { <span class=3D"pl-c1">font-size</span>=
<span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> <span class=3D"pl-c1">2<span class=3D"pl-sm=
i">rem</span></span>; <span class=3D"pl-c1">color</span><span class=3D"pl-k=
os">:</span> <span class=3D"pl-pds"><span class=3D"pl-kos">#</span>333</spa=
n>; }
  <span class=3D"pl-ent">a</span>  { <span class=3D"pl-c1">color</span><spa=
n class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> blue; }
}

<span class=3D"pl-k">@layer</span> components {
  .<span class=3D"pl-c1">card</span> { <span class=3D"pl-c1">border-radius<=
/span><span class=3D"pl-kos">:</span> <span class=3D"pl-c1">8<span class=3D=
