<td>Default =E2=80=94 element is always rendered</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>hidden</code></td>
<td>Like <code>display: none</code> for rendering, but the subtree is maint=
ained in memory (instant reveal)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>auto</code></td>
<td>Browser skips off-screen rendering; renders when near the viewport</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>
