<p dir=3D"auto">Specificity is calculated as a three-part value <strong>(A,=
 B, C)</strong> where <strong>A &gt; B &gt; C</strong> =E2=80=94 a higher v=
alue in A always beats a higher value in C, regardless of count.</p>
