<p dir=3D"auto">Browser compatibility is a shared team responsibility. Mana=
ged poorly, it leads to ad-hoc hacks and inconsistent experiences.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Establish a browser support matrix:</strong></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Define and document which browsers and versions the project=
 officially supports (e.g., last 2 versions of Chrome, Firefox, Edge, Safar=
i; no IE). Store this in <code>.browserslistrc</code> and share it with the=
 team.</p>
